<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sagaso ze! Doragon Booru</i></font>

6
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:20,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go seek them out! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

7
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:24,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto yukai na kiseki</i></font>

8
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:24,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>One of the most delightful miracles in the world</i></font>

9
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

10
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

11
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:33,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

12
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:33,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

13
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:38,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Mune waku-waku no ai ga GISSIRI</i></font>

14
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:38,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>The love of a pounding chest is GISSIRI</i></font>

15
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:42,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Iro toridori no yume ga DOSSARI</i></font>

16
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:42,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Multi-colored dreams rain down DOSSARI</i></font>

17
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:49,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo no doko ka de hikatte 'ru</i></font>

18
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:49,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Somewhere in this world, they are glowing</i></font>

19
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:52,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Soitsu mitsuke ni yuko ze BOY</i></font>

20
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:52,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go on out there and find them, boy</i></font>

21
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:56,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Yokai henge mo buttobashi</i></font>

22
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:56,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>All the while pounding on mutants and monsters</i></font>

23
00:00:56,070 --> 00:01:02,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kumo no mashin de kyo mo tobu no sa</i></font>

24
00:00:56,070 --> 00:01:02,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>And we'll fly through the day</i>
<i>on our cloud machine as well!</i></font>

25
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:06,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Let's try, try, try makafushigi</i></font>

26
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:06,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's try, try, try, how mysterious</i></font>

27
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:09,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sora o kakenuke yama o koe</i></font>

28
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:09,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Charging through the sky,</i>
<i>while we overcome mountains!</i></font>

29
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:13,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Let's fly, fly, fly, daiboken</i></font>

30
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:13,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's fly, fly, fly, such an adventure</i></font>

31
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:21,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi na tabi ga hajimaru ze</i></font>

32
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:21,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Our strange little journey now begins!</i></font>

33
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:24,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Te ni irero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

34
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:24,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's get them in hand! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

35
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:28,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto tegowai chansu</i></font>

36
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:28,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>One of the most formidable gambles in the world</i></font>

37
00:01:28,470 --> 00:01:31,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oikakero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

38
00:01:28,470 --> 00:01:31,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go chase them down! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

39
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:35,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto ikashita dorama</i></font>

40
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:35,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Some of the most enjoyable drama in the world</i></font>

41
00:01:35,110 --> 00:01:38,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

42
00:01:35,110 --> 00:01:38,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

43
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:48,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

44
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:48,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:01:54,650 --> 00:02:00,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Three years have passed since</i>
<i>Goku defeated Piccolo Daimao.</i></font>

46
00:01:57,700 --> 00:02:02,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}"Tenkaichi Budokai"</font>

47
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:12,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Now it's time for the Tenkaichi Budokai,</i>
<i>which has been eagerly anticipated by all.</i></font>

48
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:15,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>A steady stream of fighters seeking the title</i></font>

49
00:02:15,090 --> 00:02:18,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>of "number-one martial artist</i>
<i>under heaven" have gathered here.</i></font>

50
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:41,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"The Reunion Before the Storm"</font>

51
00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:50,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All fighters who wish to enter the
tournament must register today!</font>

52
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:52,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please be aware that if
you fail to register today,</font>

53
00:02:52,830 --> 00:02:56,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">you will be unable to participate
in tomorrow's qualifying rounds!</font>

54
00:03:06,690 --> 00:03:10,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where could everyone be?</font>

55
00:03:10,690 --> 00:03:15,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't tell me that they've
forgotten about today, of all days...</font>

56
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:20,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh?!</font>

57
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:26,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pu-erh! Oolong! Over here!</font>

58
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:45,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's great to see you again!</font>

59
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma-<i>san</i>!</font>

60
00:03:46,470 --> 00:03:48,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The others aren't here yet?</font>

61
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No...</font>

62
00:03:58,990 --> 00:04:04,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm at a loss for words!
You've grown even <i>more</i> feminine!</font>

63
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:07,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Keep your hands off my rear!</font>

64
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:11,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see your personality
hasn't matured, though!</font>

65
00:04:11,770 --> 00:04:15,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Neither has yours!</font>

66
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:20,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, what about Yamucha?
He was with you, was he not?</font>

67
00:04:20,220 --> 00:04:24,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He came back to Metro West once,
and then he went off somewhere...</font>

68
00:04:24,690 --> 00:04:27,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He left to train by himself.</font>

69
00:04:27,730 --> 00:04:30,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And left me behind!</font>

70
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:34,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha too, eh?</font>

71
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:39,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn never came back at all!</font>

72
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:41,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn, too?</font>

73
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:45,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They must have been enormously
motivated by Goku three years ago.</font>

74
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:50,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't wait to see how much
stronger they've grown!</font>

75
00:04:50,050 --> 00:04:53,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Catch it!</font>

76
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:57,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please!</font>

77
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:11,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't cry, I'll get it for you!</font>

78
00:05:27,570 --> 00:05:28,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't get it!</font>

79
00:05:28,910 --> 00:05:31,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oolong! You get it!</font>

80
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:35,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How am I supposed to reach
something <i>you</i> can't reach?</font>

81
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:38,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Turn into a giant or something, I don't know.</font>

82
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, I <i>guess</i> I could...</font>

83
00:05:40,590 --> 00:05:44,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hold on. I'll get it for you.</font>

84
00:05:44,590 --> 00:05:48,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But in return for the favor...</font>

85
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:53,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Could you, uh...</font>

86
00:05:53,670 --> 00:05:55,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Could I <i>what</i>?!</font>

87
00:05:55,230 --> 00:05:57,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, never mind!</font>

88
00:06:01,570 --> 00:06:03,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hi!</font>

89
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:07,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you know him?</font>

90
00:06:07,170 --> 00:06:11,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No. Do you know him, Oolong?</font>

91
00:06:11,940 --> 00:06:14,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pu-erh?</font>

92
00:06:14,110 --> 00:06:16,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No...</font>

93
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:19,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um...</font>

94
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:30,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here you go, Bulma!</font>

95
00:06:30,090 --> 00:06:33,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How do you know my name?</font>

96
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:36,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Old-timer! I'm so glad you're alive again!</font>

97
00:06:36,770 --> 00:06:39,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You all look great!</font>

98
00:06:39,370 --> 00:06:42,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? "Old-timer"?</font>

99
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:48,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where's Kuririn, Yamucha,
Tenshinhan, and Chaozu?</font>

100
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:51,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- It...
...can't be!</font>

101
00:06:51,210 --> 00:06:54,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Goku!</font>

102
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:58,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's wrong? Isn't it obvious?</font>

103
00:06:58,080 --> 00:07:02,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}"Tenkaichi Budokai"</font>

104
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:06,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, good! The rain's letting up!</font>

105
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:09,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you really Goku?!</font>

106
00:07:09,230 --> 00:07:13,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? You can't tell it's me with
this wrapped around my head?</font>

107
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:16,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here, I'll take it off! Then you can see!</font>

108
00:07:30,150 --> 00:07:32,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? Are you convinced now?</font>

109
00:07:32,420 --> 00:07:34,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm Son Goku!</font>

110
00:07:37,990 --> 00:07:40,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Lady!</font>

111
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My balloon?</font>

112
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, here you are!</font>

113
00:07:43,530 --> 00:07:45,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you!</font>

114
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:50,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma! Did you and the
Old-timer shrink or something?</font>

115
00:07:50,370 --> 00:07:52,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, <i>you</i> really grew up!</font>

116
00:07:52,810 --> 00:07:56,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now that you mention it, maybe
I did grow a little taller, huh?</font>

117
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did! You did!</font>

118
00:07:57,450 --> 00:08:00,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was only natural that we
couldn't recognize you right away!</font>

119
00:08:00,790 --> 00:08:04,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma! Your lips are red! Are you sick?!</font>

120
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:08,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ugh! It's lipstick! Lipstick!</font>

121
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yep! He's definitely Son-<i>kun</i>!</font>

122
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:14,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All fighters wishing to
participate in the tournament</font>

123
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:18,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">are requested to register
as soon as possible!</font>

124
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:21,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku! Hurry and register!</font>

125
00:08:21,650 --> 00:08:24,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Have Kuririn and the others
registered yet, Old-timer?</font>

126
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:27,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It seems they have yet to arrive.</font>

127
00:08:27,430 --> 00:08:30,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, I'll be back in a minute!</font>

128
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:33,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How astonishing!</font>

129
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:40,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't believe it! That Son-<i>kun</i>'s grown
up into such a handsome young man!</font>

130
00:08:40,070 --> 00:08:44,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha is even handsomer!</font>

131
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:47,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh? Are you sure?</font>

132
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:49,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fickle woman.</font>

133
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:01,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The register desk will be closing shortly!</font>

134
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:05,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please hurry if you haven't registered yet!</font>

135
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:11,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Something has come up, so a couple
of entrants have yet to arrive...</font>

136
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:13,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can I register for them?</font>

137
00:09:13,330 --> 00:09:19,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Only participants themselves may
register, so we cannot allow that.</font>

138
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:21,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No luck, Old-timer?</font>

139
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:22,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No.</font>

140
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:27,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's Tenshinhan, the champion from
the last tournament, and some others...</font>

141
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:30,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sorry, but...</font>

142
00:09:30,110 --> 00:09:33,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see. So, how much time do they have left?</font>

143
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Five minutes.</font>

144
00:09:34,950 --> 00:09:38,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh? Five minutes?!</font>

145
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:40,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll go look for them!</font>

146
00:09:42,660 --> 00:09:45,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What could they be doing?</font>

147
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:52,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Three minutes remaining!</font>

148
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you suppose they won't show up?</font>

149
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They'll be here soon!</font>

150
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:59,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Two minutes remaining!</font>

151
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:19,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Worrying me to death as usual!</i></font>

152
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:25,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Any luck, Pu-erh?</font>

153
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:29,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I couldn't find any sign of them at all...</font>

154
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One minute remaining!</font>

155
00:10:31,970 --> 00:10:35,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oolong! Transform into Yamucha
and the others and sign up for them!</font>

156
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no problem with it,</font>

157
00:10:36,810 --> 00:10:38,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but after I transform,</font>

158
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:41,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have to wait one minute until
I can do another transformation.</font>

159
00:10:41,450 --> 00:10:43,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Which means I can only
transform into one person.</font>

160
00:10:43,490 --> 00:10:48,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can transform into Yamucha-<i>sama</i>, but...</font>

161
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:51,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But that would leave Tenshinhan
and Chaozu out, wouldn't it?</font>

162
00:10:51,490 --> 00:10:54,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But there's no other choice!</font>

163
00:10:54,030 --> 00:10:56,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In this situation, even if
it's just Yamucha and Kuririn...</font>

164
00:10:56,630 --> 00:11:00,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But that would be unfair
to Tenshinhan and Chaozu!</font>

165
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They made it in time!</font>

166
00:11:08,210 --> 00:11:10,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Over at last...</font>

167
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Yamucha!
- Tenshinhan!</font>

168
